hadiths[108]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2415","Abdul-Wahhab bin Al-Ward ne Madinah ke ek sahri ki riwayat ki, jisne farmaya:\n\n\Mu'awiyah (رضي الله عنه) ne Aisha (رضي الله عنها) ko ek khat likha...\"""""
"2416","Adi bin Hatim (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Tum mein se koi bhi aisa nahi jo Qayamat ke din uske Rab se baat na karega.\"""""
"2417","Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Qayamat ke din Adam ki aulad ke pair qayamat ke din apne Rubb ke saamne tab tak nahi hiltenge jab tak us se paanch cheezein poochi na jaayein.\"""""
"2418","Abu Barzah Al-Aslami (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Banda-e-Khuda ke qadam Qayamat ke din tab tak nahi hilein ge jab tak us se paanch cheezein poochi na jaayein: uski umar ke baare mein ke us ne is ka kya kiya...\"""""
"2419","Abu Hurairah (radiyallahu anhu) rivayat farmaatay hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Kya tum jaano kaun muflis hota hai?\"" \nSahaba (radiyallahu anhum) ne arz ki: \""Ya Rasoolallah (sallallahu alaihi wasal)! Hamare yehann muflis woh hai jiske paas na koi dirham ho na koi maal.\"" \nRasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \""Meri Ummat mein muflis woh hai jo Qayamat ke din apne saath namaz"," roza aur zakat le kar aaye.\"""""
"2420","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Allah Ta'ala us bandeh par rehmat naazil kare jis ne apne bhai ki izzat ya us ke maal mein us par zulm kiya.\"""""
"2421","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Haqooq apne haqdar ko diye jayenge.\"""""
"2422","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah un se) ne riwayat farmaya ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Ghareeb log ameer logon se paanch saal pehle Jannat mein dakhil honge"," jo ke din ka aadha hai.\"" Ye ek hasan sahih hadith hai."""
"2423","Abu Hurairah (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Muslim ghareeb log ameer logon se aadhe din pehle jannat mein dakhil honge"," jo paanch saal ke barabar hai.\""\n\nAur yeh sahih hadith hai."""
"2424","Ibn 'Abbas (raz) se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah (s.a.w) ne farmaya: \Qayamat ke din log nange pair ikathey jayenge.\"""""
"2425","Ahmad ibn Mani' ne ham se riwayat ki, Abbad ibn Abbad al-Muhalabi ne riwayat ki, Mujalid se riwayat hai, unhon ne al-Sha'bi se riwayat ki, aur unhon ne Masruq se riwayat ki, unhone kaha:\n\nMain Aisha (Razi Allah Anha) ke paas gaya, unhone mere liye khilaya aur farmaya: \Main kabhi itni bhari hui thi ke roye hon"," magar maine ro liya.\"" Maine poocha: \""Kyun?\"" Unhon ne farmaya: \""Main yaad karti hoon us haal ko jis par Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasalamm) ne duniya chhodi. Wallah"," unhone kabhi ek din mein do baar roti aur goshat se pet bhar kar nahi khaya.\""\n\nAbu Isa (Tirmizi) ne farmaya: Ye hasan sahih hadith hai."""
"2426","Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Qayamat ke din logon ke saamne teen peshiyan hongi. Do peshiyon ke mutalliq...\"""""
"2427","Ibn Abi Mulaikah ne riwayat ki ke Aishah (radiy Allahu anha) ne farmaya: \Main ne Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: \""Jis shakhs se uska hisab poocha jaye...\"""""
"2428","Anas (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Qayamat ke din Adam ki aulaed ko Allah ke saamne is tarah khada kiya jayega jaise ek chhota bakra khada kiya jata hai.\"""""
"2429","Abu Salih ne Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anh) aur Abu Sa'eed (raziyallahu anh) se riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Qayamat ke din banda (bande ko) laya jayega...\"""""
"2430","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne padha: \Us din zameen apni khabron ko bayan kar degi.\"" Phir farmaya: \""Kya tum jaante ho ke uski khabrein kya hain?\"" Sab ne kaha: \""Allah aur uske Rasool hi behtar jaante hain.\"" Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \""Beshak uski yeh khabrein hain ke woh har bande ke khilaf gawahi degi.\"""""
"2431","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-As RadiAllahu Anhuma ne farmaya: \n\Ek bedouin Nabiyy-e-Akram SallAllahu Alaihi Wasallam ke paas aaya aur puchta: 'Sur kya hai?' Aap SallAllahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: 'Ek soor (horn) jismein phoonka jayega.'\"" \n\nAbu Eisa Rahimahullah ne kaha: \n\""Yeh Hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Isay Sulaiman At-Taimi se aksar rawi ne riwayat ki hai.\"""""
"2432","Abu Sa'eed (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: \Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: 'Main kaise chain se raha ja sakta hoon jabke soor wala apne hont par soor pakad ke hai?'\"""""
"2433","Al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah (radiyAllahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallAllahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \n\Momin ke nishaniyan Sirat par yeh hain: Ya Rabb!\"""""
"2434","An-Nadr bin Anas bin Malik ne apne baare mein riwaayat ki, unhon ne kaha: \Main ne Nabi (s.a.w) se dua ki ke Qayamat ke Din mere liye shifa'at farmayein. Unhon ne farmaya: 'Main hi woh hoon jo karunga.'\"" [Unhon ne kaha:] \""Main ne kaha: 'Ya Rasool Allah! Toh main aap ko kahan dhoondhoon?' Unhon ne farmaya: 'Mujh ko"""
"2435","Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: \Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas gosha-e-gosht laaye gaye aur unke saamne reza-e-uzu (foreleg) pesh kiya gaya.\"""""
"2436","Anas (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Meri shafa'at ummat-i mujh mein woh logon ke liye hain jo kabaa'ir (bade gunaahon) karne wale hon.\"" Ek doosri silsile mein bhi isi jaisi riwayat milti hai."""
"2437","# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\nAl-ʿAbbās ibn Muḥammad al-Dūrī ne hamain sunāyā, ʿAbdullāh ibn Yazīd ne hamain sunāyā, Ḥaywah ibn Shurayḥ ne hamain sunāyā, Abū Hānīʾ al-Khawlānī ne mujhe ittilāʿ dī ki Abū ʿAlī ʿAmr ibn Mālik al-Janbī ne unhein Faḍālah ibn ʿUbayd رضي الله عنه se sunāyā ki:\n\n**Jab Rasūlullāh ﷺ logon ko namāz paṛhātē tō un mēṅ se kuch ādmī namāz hī mēṅ gir paṛ jātē thē, bhūk aur kamzorī kī wajah sē. Yeh Aṣḥāb-e-Ṣuffah thē (Masjid-e-Nabawī kī chhāṓṅ wālī jagah ke sāthī). Badwā un ke bāre mēṅ kahtē thē ke \Yeh log dīwānē haiṅ\"" yeh \""Yeh pagal haiṅ.\""**\n\n**Jab Rasūlullāh ﷺ namāz se farāghat farmātē tō un kī taraf muṛ kar farmātē:**\n\n> **\""Agar tum jāntē ke Allāh Taʿālā kī huzūr mēṅ tumhārē liye kyā intizār hai"," tō tum ghurbat aur zarūrat mēṅ izāfā kō muhabbat kartē.\""**\n\nFaḍālah رضي الله"""
"2438","Abu Umamah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Mere Rabb ne mujh se wada kiya hai ke meri Ummah se sattar hazar log bina hisaab ke aur bina kisi saza ke Jannat mein daakhil kiye jayenge. Har hazar ke saath"""
"2439","Abdullah bin Shaqiq (رضي الله عنه) ne bayan farmaya:\n\n\Main Bait-ul-Muqaddas mein ek daste ke saath tha.\"""""
"2440","Al-Hasan Al-Basri ne farmaya: \Rasool Allah (s.a.w) ne farmaya: \""Qayamat ke din...\"""""
"2441","Abu Sa'eed (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Yaqeenan meri Ummat mein aise log bhi hain jo bade giroh ke liye shifa'at karte hain.\"""""
"2442","Abu Al-Malih riwayat karte hain ke 'Awf bin Malik Al-Ashja'i ne farmaya: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Mere paas mere Rab ki taraf se aik aaya aur mujhe ikhtiyar diya ke meri Ummah ka aadha hissa Jannat mein dakhil kiya jaye ya shifa'at (sifaarish) di jaye. Main ne shifa'at ka intikhab kiya.\"""""
"2443","Anas bin Malik (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak...\"""""
"2444","Samurah (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Yaqeenan har Nabi ke liye ek Hawd (hauz) hai.\"""""
"2445","Al-'Abbas ne Abu Sallam Al-Habashi se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: \Umar bin Abdul-Aziz ne mujhe bulaya"," to main ek gadhe par sawar hua.\"" [Kaha:] \""Jab woh uske paas dakhil hue...\"""""
"2446","Abu Dharr (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: Main ne kaha: \Ya Rasoolallah! Hawd (حوض) ke bartanon ke baare mein kya hai?\"" Aap (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ne farmaya: \""Us zaat ki qasam jis ke qaboo mein meri jaan hai! Uski bartanon ki tadad aasmaanon ke sitaaron aur saaf andhere ki raat ke sayyaaron se zyada hai. Woh Jannat ke bartanon mein se hain.\"""""
"2447","Ibn 'Abbas (razi Allahu anhuma) ne riwayat ki: \Jab Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Shab-e-Mi'raj ka safar kiya gaya...\"""""
"2448","Abu 'Imaran Al-Jawni ne riwayat ki: Anas bin Malik (r.a.) ne farmaya: \Main aaj kuch bhi nahi pahchaan sakta jo hum The Messenger of Allah (s.a.w.) ke zamaane par tha.\"" Maine kaha: \""Toh Salat ke baare mein?\"" Unhon ne farmaya: \""Kya tum logon ne woh nahi kiya jo tum jaante ho (ki tumne kiya hai)?\"" Doosri silsilon mein bhi isi tarah ki riwayatein milti hain."""
"2449","Asma bint 'Umais Al-Khath'amiyyah (radiy Allahu 'anha) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: *\Bura banda woh hai jo khud ko bada samjhe aur ghuroor mein pad kar sab se Azeem (Allah) ko bhool jaye.\""*"""
"2450","Abū ʿĪsā (raḥimahullāh) ne farmāyā: Ye ḥasan ṣaḥīh ḥadīth hai, is silsile se gharīb hai.\n\nAbū Kurayb ne hamāre sune, Muʿāwiyah ibn Hishām ne hamāre sune, Shaybān se, Firās se, ʿAṭiyyah se, Abū Saʿīd (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhu) se, unhone farmāyā: Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne farmāyā: \Jo shakhs riyākārī kare"," Allāh usay be-ʿizzat karegā"," aur jo shakhs shohrat kā ṭālib ho"," Allāh usay ruswā karegā.\""\n\nAur Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne yeh bhī farmāyā: \""Jo shakhs logon par raḥmat na kare"," Allāh us par raḥmat na karegā.\""\n\nIs bāb mein Jundub aur ʿAbdullāh ibn ʿAmr (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhumā) kī riwāyāt bhī hain."""
"2451","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \n\Jise raat ko safar karne ka darr ho — aur jo raat ko safar kare"," woh apne maqasad tak pohanch jata hai — Allah usay sab se qeemti cheez ata farmata hai.\"""""
"2452","Rabi'ah bin Yazid aur 'Atiyyah bin Qais ne 'Atiyyah As-Sa'di (رضي الله عنه) se riwayat ki, aur woh Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke Sahaba mein se the, ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya:\n\n\Banda muttaqon mein shamil nahi ho sakta jab tak woh aisi cheez chhod de jismein koi nuqsan na ho"," isliye ke uske nuqsan se bachne ke liye ehtiyaat kare.\"""""
"2453","Hanzalah Al-Usaiyyidi (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne farmaya: \اگر تم ہمیشہ اسی طرح رہو جیسے تم میرے ساتھ ہوتے ہو\"""""
"2454","Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Yaqeenan har cheez ke liye ek himmat aur junoon hota hai.\"""""
"2455","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamare liye zameen par ek murabba (chaukorni) rekha kheench di."
"2456","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Banda-e-Adam budha ho jaata hai"," lekin do cheezein usse jawan rakhti hain: umar ki tamanna aur maal ki tamanna.\"""""
"2457","Mutarrif bin 'Abdullah bin Ash-Shikh-khir (raziyallahu anhu) ne apni taraf se apne baap (raziyallahu anhu) ki rivaayat ki, aur unho ne Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se naql farmaya ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Ibn-e-Adam ka haal yeh hai ke woh nintis (99) musibatoon ke gird ghera hua hota hai.\"""""
"2458","At-Tufail bin Ubayy bin Ka'b ne apne walid (father) se riwayat ki, unhone farmaya: \n\Jab raat ka tisra hissa guzar chuka hota...\"""""
"2459","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (r.a.) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (s.a.w.) ne farmaya: \Allah ke liye istaqarar ki Haya' rakho"," jaisa uska haq hai.\"" \n[Unhon ne kaha:] Hum ne arz kiya: \""Ya Nabiullah! Hum Haya' rakhte hain...\"""""
"2460","Shaddad bin Aws (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Aqalmand woh hai jo apne nafs ko qaboo mein kar le.\"""""
"2461","Abu Sa'eed (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne namaz ki jagah (musalla) mein tashreef lae aur logon ko dekha, jinke chehre aise the goya woh muskura rahe hain. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak...\"""""
"2462","Hannād aur Qutaybahah ne ham se riwāyat bayaan kī, dono ne kahā: Ḥātim ibn Ismāʿīl ne ham se riwāyat kī, ʿImrān ibn Muslim al-Qaṣīr se, Saʿīd ibn Salmān se, Yazīd ibn Nuʿāmah al-Ḍabbī se, unhone kahā:\n\nRasūlullāh, ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam ne farmayā:\n\n**\Jab koi ādmī kisī dūsre ādmī se ukhuwwat (brotherhood) qāyam kare"," to us se uskā nām"," uske wālid kā nām aur uskī qabīlā yā nasab daryāft kare"," kyunki yeh mukhlis muhabbat ke qāyam kā sabab tareeqa hai.\""**\n\nAbū ʿĪsā (Tirmidhī) ne tafsīl se kahā: *\""Yeh ek gharīb (nādir/wāḥid) hadīs hai. Ham ise is silsile (chain) ke siwā aur kahīṅ nahīṅ jānte. Iske alāwā"," hamen ilm nahīṅ ke Yazīd ibn Nuʿāmah ne Rasūlullāh"," ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam se koi samāʿ (direct audition) rakkhtā ho. Is jaisī aur riwāyat Ibn ʿUmar"," raḍiyallāhu ʿanhu se bhi mā'rūf hai"," lekin uskā isnād (chain of transmission) sahīh nahīṅ hai.\""*"""
"2463","Al-Mustwarad bin Makhramah ne riwayat ki ke Amir bin 'Awf ne unhe bataya — aur woh Banu 'Amr bin Lu'ay ke halif the, jo Rasool Allah (s.a.w) ke saath Badr ki lashkar mein shareek hue the."
"2464","Urwah bin Zubair (rhmh allh) awr abn msyb (rhmh allh) say rwayt hay kh hkm bn hzam (rzy allh anh) nay frmaya: \myn nay rswl allh ﷺ say (kchh) manga tw aap nay mjhay day dya۔ phr myn nay aap ﷺ say (dwbarh) manga tw aap nay mjhay day dya۔ phr myn nay aap ﷺ say (ayk bar phr) manga tw aap nay mjhay day dya۔ phr myn nay aap ﷺ say (ayk bar awr) manga۔"""
"2465","Abdur-Rahman bin 'Awf (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne farmaya: \Hum Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke saath museebat mein mubtala kiye gaye."""
"2466","Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jo shakhsaakh aakhirat ko apna maqsad bana le...\"""""
"2467","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak Allah Ta'ala...\"""""
"2468","Aishah (radiyAllahu anha) ne farmaya: \RasoolAllah (sallAllahu alaihi wa sallam) ki wafat hui aur humare paas ek shatr jo (jis ki matra ek saa ki hoti hai) jau (barley) thi. Hum ne us mein se Allah ki mashiyat ke mutabiq kha liya.\"""""
"2469","Aishah (raziyallahu anha) ne riwayat kiya: \Hamare paas ek tha jo par thi jis par kuch naqsh-o-nigaron the aur woh mere darwaze par parday ki soorat mein latka hua tha. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay dekha aur farmaaya: 'Isay hata do.'\"""""
"2470","Aishah (radiyAllahu anha) ne riwayat farmayi: \Rasool Allah (sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam) ke paas ek chamra ka tha jo khoor se bhara hua tha aur woh us par takiya lagate the.\"""""
"2471","Abu Maisarah (raziyallahu anhu) ne Hazrat Aishah (radiyallaha anha) se riwayat ki ke unhon ne ek bakri zabah ki."
"2472","**Tarjama (Scholarly Roman Urdu):**\n\nMuhammad ibn Humayd al-Razi aur Yusuf ibn Musa al-Qattan al-Baghdadi ne riwayat ki, donon ne farmaya: Abd al-Rahman ibn Maghra', Abu Zuhayr ne humein riwayat ki, unho ne al-A'mash se, unho ne Abu al-Zubayr se, unho ne Jabi (radi Allahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya:\n\nRasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya:\n\n> \Qayamat ke din ahl-e-aafiyat (khushhaal log) yeh tamanna karenge ke jab ahl-e-bala (mushkilat mein rehne walon) ko unka ajar diya jaye ke kash duniya mein unki jild qaalon se kaat di jati.\""\n\nYeh ek gharib hadith hai; hum is isnad ke siwa is hadith ko is silsila se nahi jaante. Baaz rawis ne is hadith ka ek hissa al-A'mash se"," Talhah ibn Musarrif se"," Masroq se"," apni qawl (qawlahu) ki haisiyat se riwayat kiya hai."""
"2473","Anas (r.a.) rivayat karte hain ke Rasoolullah (s.a.w.) ne farmaya: \Yaqeenan main ne Allah ki taraf se darr rakha hai...\"""""
"2474","Muhammad bin Ka'b Al-Qurazi ne farmaya: \n\Mujh se kisi ne riwayat ki ke unhone Ali bin Abi Talib (radi Allahu anho) se suna ke unhone farmaya: \nMain ek sard din mein Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke ghar se nikla. Maine ek rangin chamra liya tha.\"""""
"2475","Abu 'Uthman An-Nahdi ne Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Sahaba-e-Kiram (ridwan Allahu ajma'in) ko bhook ki sakht mushkilat thi, to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne har ek ko ek khajoor di."
"2476","Jabir bin 'Abdullah (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne riwayat ki:\n\n\Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne humein bheja...\"""""
"2477","Yazid bin Ziyad ne Muhammad bin Ka'b Al-Qurazi se riwayat ki, unhone Abu Talib se suna, unhone farmaya:\n\n\Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki mehfil mein baitha hua tha"," jab Mus'ab bin Umair (radhiyallahu anhu) hamare saamne zahir hue...\"""""
"2478","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: \As-Suffah wale log Islam ke mehman the.\"""""
"2479","Yahya Al-Bakka' ne Ibn 'Umar (razi Allahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke unhone farmaya: \Ek shakhs ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke saamne qay ki.\"""""
"2480","Abu Burdah bin Abi Musa (r.a.) rivayat farmate hain ke unke baap (Abu Musa r.a.) ne farmaya: \n\Agar tu ne dekha hota jab hum Nabi (s.a.w.) ke saath the aur aasmaan ne hum par barasaat ki hoti...\"""""
"2481","Abu Abdullah, Muhammad ibn Abi Thalgh al-Baghdadi, Ahmad ibn Hanbal ke sahaba ne humein riwayat sunayi. Ali ibn Hafs ne humein kaha: Ibrahim ibn Abdullah ibn Hatim ne humein riwayat ki, Abdullah ibn Dinar se, Ibn Umar (radhiAllahu anhu) se, jo RasoolAllah (sallAllahu alayhi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke unhone farmaya:\n\n\Allah ki zikr ke baghair zyada baat na karo"," kyunke Allah ki zikr ke baghair zyada baat dil ko sakht kar deti hai"," aur Allah se sab door woh shakhs hai jiska dil sakht ho.\""\n\nAbu Bakr ibn al-Nadr ne bhi humein riwayat sunayi"," unhone kaha: Abu al-Nadr ne mujhe riwayat ki"," Ibrahim ibn Abdullah ibn Hatim se"," Abdullah ibn Dinar se"," Ibn Umar (radhiAllahu anhu) se"," Nabi (sallAllahu alayhi wasallam se"," isi ma'ni wali mushabih riwayat.\n\nAbu Isa (al-Tirmidhi) ne farmaya: Yeh gharib (nadir) hasan (achhi) hadith hai. Hum is sirf Ibrahim ibn Abdullah ibn Hatim ki riwayat se jaante hain."""
"2482","Muhammad ibn Bashshar aur doosron ne humein riwayat sunayi, unhone kaha: Muhammad ibn Yazid ibn Khunays al-Makki ne humein riwayat sunayi, unhone kaha: Maine Sa'id ibn Hassan al-Makhzumi ko yeh kehte hue suna ke Umm Salih ne mujh ko riwayat sunayi, woh Safiyyah bint Shaybah se riwayat karti hain, aur woh Umm Habibah (raziya Allahu anha), Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zaujan-e-muqaddas se riwayat karti hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Beta-e-Adam ki saari baatein uske khilaf hain"," uske haqq mein nahi"," magar achi baat ka hukum dena"," buri baat se rokna"," ya Allah ki zikr karna.\""\n\nAbu Isa (al-Tirmidhi) ne farmaya: Yeh hasan gharib hadith hai. Hum ise sirf Muhammad ibn Yazid ibn Khunays ki riwayat ke siwa nahi jaante."""
"2483","Shahib bin Bashir ne Anas bin Malik (razi Allahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Tamam kharchat Allah ki raah mein hain.\"""""
"2484","Harithah bin Mudarrib ne farmaya: \Hum Khabbab (رضي الله عنه) ke paas un ki iyadat ke liye gaye"," jinhon ne apne jism par jalon ke saat jagah khud jala rakhi thin. Unhon ne farmaya: 'Mujhe bahut arsay se bimari hai"," aur agar main aisi baat na sunta jo maine suni"," to yaqeenan main apna sar kaat leta — yani is qadar tangdil aur pareshan tha ke qurbani bhi muqaddar ho chuka tha.'\"""""
"2485","mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko ye farmatey huye suna : ''ye maal sarsabz aur mitha hai padhi. jisney usey halal tareeqey sey hasil kya uskey liye is mein barkat hogi aur kitney aisey hain jo Allah aur uskey Rasool key maal ko haram o najaaiz tariqa sey hasil karney waley hain unkey liye qiyamat key din jahannam ki aag tayyar hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2486","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' Dinar ka banda maloon hai, dirham ka banda maloon hai''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan gharib hai, 2- ye hadees is sanad key ilawa « an abi Saleh an abi Hurera an Nabi sallallahu Alehi wasallam » ki sanad sey marvi hai aur ye bhi sanad us sey ziyada mukammal aur taweel hai."
"2487","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' do bhookey bhediye jinhen bakriyon key rewad mein chhod diya jaey itna nuqsan nahin pahunchaaeyngey jitna nuqsan aadmi key maal o jaah ki hirs uskey Deen ko pahunchati hai'' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi riwayat hai, aur wo Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat kartey hain lekin iski sanad sahih nahin hai."
"2488","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam eik chataai par so gaey, neend sey bedaar huye to aap key pehlu par chataai ka nishan pad gaya tha, Sahaba ney arz kya : Allah key Rasool ! hum aap key liye eik bichona bana den to behtar hoga, aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' mujhey duniya sey kya matlab hai, meri aur duniya ki misal aisi hai jaisey eik sawar ho jo eik darkht key nichey saya hasil karney key liye bethey, phir wahan sey kooch kar jaey aur darkht ko usi jagah chhod dey''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein ibne-Umar aur ibne-Abbas (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2489","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''aadmi apney dost key Deen par hota hai, isliye tum mein sey har shakhs ko ye dekhna chahiye ke wo kis sey dosti kar raha hai''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
"2490","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''murdey key sath qabr tak teen cheezen jati hain, phir do cheezen lot aati hain aur sath main eik baqi reh jati hai, uskey rishtedaar, uska maal aur uskey aamal sath mein jatey hain phir rishtedaar, aur maal lot aatey hain aur sirf uska amal uskey sath baqi reh jata hai''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2491","mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko ye farmatey huye suna : '' kisi aadmi ney koi bartan apney pet sey ziyada bura nahin bhara, aadmi key liye chand luqmey hi kafi hain jo uski peeth ko sidha rakhen aur agar ziyada hi khana zaruri ho to pet ka eik tihai hissey apney khaney key liye, eik tihai pani peeney key liye aur eik tihai saans leney key liye baqi rakhey'' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2492","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo riyaakaari kerega to Allah Taala qiyamat key din usey logon key samney zahir kar dega , aur jo Allah ki ibadat shohrat key liye kerega to Allah Taala qiyamat key din usey ruswa aur zaleel kerega.''  farmaya : ''jo logon par reham nahin karta is par Allah Taala bhi reham nahin karta.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan sahih gharib hai. 2- is bab mein Jundub aur Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2493","eik martaba wo Madina mein dakhil huye, achcha eik aadmi ko dekha jis key paas kuchh log jama they, unhoney puchha ke ye kon hain? logon ney jawaaban arz kiya : ye Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) hain, Shafiya Asbahi ka bayan hai ke main unkey qarib huwa yahan tak ke unkey samney beth gaya aur wo logon sey hadees bayan kar rahey they, jab wo hadees bayan kar chukey aur tanha reh gaey to mainey un sey kaha : main aap sey Allah ka baar-baar wasta dey kar poochh raha hun ke aap mujh sey aisi hadees bayan kijiye jisey aap ney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey suna ho aur usey achchhi tarah jana aur samjha ho. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : theek hai, yaqinan main tum sey aisi hadees bayan karunga jisey mujh sey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney bayan kiya hai aur mainey usey achchhi tarah jana aur samjha hai. phir Abu-Hurera ney zor ki cheekh maari aur behosh ho gaey, thodi der baad jab ifaaqa (faaida) huwa to farmaya : yaqinan main tum sey wo hadees bayan karunga jisey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney mujh sey usi ghar mein bayan kiya tha jahan merey siwa koi nahin tha, phir dobara Abu-Hurera ney cheekh maari aur behosh ho gaey, phir jab ifaaqa (faaida) huwa to apney chehrey ko ponchha aur farmaya : zarur main tum sey wo hadees bayan karunga jisey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney mujh sey bayan kiya hai aur us ghar mein merey aur aap key siwa koi nahin tha, phir Abu-Hurera ney zor ki cheekh maari aur behosh ho gaey, apney chehrey ko ponchh aur phir jab ifaaqa huwa to farmaya : zarur main tum sey wo hadees bayan karunga jisey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney mujh sey bayan kiya hai aur us ghar mein merey aur aap key siwa koi nahin tha, phir Abu-Hurera ney zor ki cheekh maari aur behosh ho kar munh key bal zamin par gir padey, mainey badi der tak unhen apna sahara diye rakha phir jab ifaaqa huwa to farmaya : Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney mujh sey ye hadees bayan ki hai : ''qiyamat key din jab har ummat ghutnon key bal padi hogi to Allah Taala apney bandon key darmiyan faisley key liye nuzool farmaeyga, phir us waqt faisla key liye sab sey pehley aisey shakhs ko bulaya jaeyga jo Quran ka Hafiz hoga, doosra shaheed hoga aur teesra maaldaar hoga, Allah Taala haafize Quran sey kaheyga : kya mainey tujhey apney Rasool par nazil karda kitab ki taalim nahin di thi ? wo kaheyga : yaqinan aey merey rab ! Allah Taala farmaeyga jo ilm tujhey sikhaya gaya uskey mutabiq tu ney kya amal kiya? wo kaheyga : main us Quran key zariey raaton din teri ibadat karta tha, Allah Taala farmaeyga : tu ney jhoot kaha aur farishtey bhi us sey kahengey ki tu ney jhoot kaha , phir Allah Taala kaheyga : (Quran seekhney sey) tera maqsad ye tha ke log tujhey qaari kahen, so tujhey kaha gaya, phir sahabe maal ko pesh kiya jaeyga aur Allah Taala us sey puchheyga : kya mainey tujhey har chiz ki wusat na dey rakhi thi, yahan tak ke tujhey kisi ka mohtaj nahin rakha? wo arz kerega : yaqinan merey rab ! Allah Taala farmaeyga : mainey tujhey jo cheezen di thin is mein kya amal kiya ? wo kaheyga : sila rehmi karta tha aur sadqa aur khairat karta tha, Allah Taala farmaeyga : tu ney jhoot kaha aur farishtey bhi usey jhutlayengey, phir Allah Taala farmaeyga : balke tum ye chahtey they ke tumhen sakhi kaha jaey, so tumhen sakhi kaha gaya, uskey baad shaheed ko pesh kiya jaeyga, Allah Taala us sey puchheyga : tujhey kis liye qatl kiya gaya? wo arz kerega : mujhey teri raah mein jihad ka hukm diya gaya chunanche mainey jihad kiya yahan tak ke shaheed ho gaya, Allah Taala us sey kaheyga : tu ney jhoot kaha, farishtey bhi usey jhutlayengey, phir Allah Taala farmaeyga : tera maqsad ye tha ke tujhey bahaadur kaha jaey so tujhey kaha gaya.''  phir Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney merey zaanu par apna haath maar kar farmaya : Abu-Hurera ! yehi wo pehley teen shakhs hain jin sey qiyamat key din jahannam ki aag bhadkai jaeygi.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : Waleed abu-Usman kehtey hain : Aqba bin Muslim ney mujhey khabar di ke Shafiya Asbahi  ney Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) key paas ja kar unhen is hadees sey ba-khabar kiya tha. abu-Usman kehtey hain : Alaa bin Abi Hakeem ney mujh sey bayan kiya ke wo Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) key jallad they, phir Muawiya key paas eik aadmi pahuncha aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) key wastey sey is hadees sey unhen ba-khabar kiya to Muawiya ney kaha : un teeno key sath aisa maamla huwa to baqi logon key sath kya hoga, ye keh kar Muawiya zaar o qatar roney lagey yahan tak ke hamney samjha ke wo zinda nahin bachengey, aur hum logon ney yahan tak keh dala ke ye shakhs shar ley kar aaya hai, phir jab Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ko ifaaqa huwa to unhoney apney chehrey ko saaf kiya aur farmaya : ''yaqeenan Allah aur uskey Rasool ney sach farmaya hai'' aur is aayate-karima ki tilawat ki :(من كان يريد الحياة الدنيا وزينتها نوف إليهم أعمالهم فيها وهم فيها لا يبخسون أولئك الذين ليس لهم في الآخرة إلا النار وحبط ما صنعوا فيها w batil ما كانوا"
"2494","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''(جب الحزن) ( gham ki wadi ( sey Allah Taala ki panah maango.''  Sahaba ney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! (جب الحزن) kya chiz hai? aap ney farmaya : ''jahannam ki eik wadi hai jis sey jahannam bhi har roz sau martaba panah maangti hai.''  phir Sahaba ney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! is mein kon log dakhil hongey? aap ney farmaya : ''riyakar Quran ke Qaari (us mein dakhil hongey).'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
"2495","eik aadmi ney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! aadmi nek amal karta hai phir usey chhipata hai lekin jab logon ko uski ittilaa ho jati hai to wo usey pasand karta hai? Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''uskey liye do ajr hain eik neki key chhipaaney ka aur doosra uskey zahir ho janey ka.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- Aamash waghera ney is hadees ko «Habeeb bin Abi Sabit an Abi Saleh an Nabi sallallahu Alehi wasallam» ki sanad sey mursalan riwayat kiya hai, aur Aamash key shagirdon ney is mein « an abi Huraira » ka zikr nahin kiya. 3- baaz ehle-ilm ney is hadees ki tafseer kartey huye farmaya : uskey nek amal key zahir ho janey par logon key pasand karney ka matlab ye hai ke logon ki tareef aur sanaa khair ko wo pasand karta hai isliye ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya hai ke ''tum log zamin par Allah key gawah ho.'' yaqinan usey logon ki tareef pasand aati hai kyonkey usey logon ki tareef sey aakhirat key khair ki ummid hoti hai, albatta agar koi logon key jaan janey par isliye khush hota hai ke uskey nek amal ko jaan kar log uski tazeem aur takrim kerengey to ye riya aur dikhaawe mein dakhil ho jaeyga. 4- aur baaz ehle-ilm ney iski tafseer ye ki hai ke logon key jaan janey par wo isliye khush hota hai ke nek amal mein log uski iqtida (pairvi) kerengey aur usey bhi unkey aamal mein ajr milega to ye khushi bhi munasib hai."
"2496","eik aadmi ney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! qiyamat kab aayegi? Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam namaz padhney key liye khadey ho gaey, phir jab namaz sey farigh huye to farmaya : ''qiyamat key barey mein sawal karney wala kahan hai?'' us aadmi ney kaha : main mojud hun Allah key Rasool ! aap ney farmaya : ''qiyamat key liye tum ney kya tayyari kar rakhi hai.''  usney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! mainey koi ziyada saum aur salaat (roza aur namaz) ikhatta nahin ki hai (yani nawaafil waghera) magar ye baat hai ke main Allah aur uskey Rasool sey mohabbat karta hun, to Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''aadmi uskey sath hoga jis sey mohabbat karta hai, aur tum bhi isi key sath ho'ogey jis sey mohabbat kartey ho.'' Anas ka bayan hai ke Islam laney key baad mainey musalmanon ko itna khush hotey nahin dekha jitna aap key is qol sey wo sab khush nazar aa rahey they. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees sahih hai."
"2497","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''har aadmi isi key sath hoga jis sey wo mohabbat karta hai aur usey wohi badla milega jo kuchh usney kamaya.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan Basri ki riwayat sey Hasan gharib hai, aur Hasan Basri ney Anas bin Malik sey aur Anas bin Malik Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat kartey hain. 2- ye hadees Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey dusri sanadon sey bhi marvi hai. 3- is bab mein Ali , Abdullah bin Masood , Safwan bin Assaal, Abu-Hurera aur abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2498","eik dehati jiski aawaz bahut bhari thi Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir huwa aur arz kiya : aey Muhammad ! eik aadmi qom sey mohabbat karta hai albatta wo un sey amal mein peechhey hai, Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''aadmi isi key sath hoga jis sey wo mohabbat karta hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2499","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Allah taala farmata hai : main apney bandey key guman key mutabiq hun jaisa wo guman mujh sey rakhey, aur main uskey sath hun jab bhi wo mujhey pukarta hai.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2500","eik aadmi ney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey neki aur badi key barey mein sawal kiya to aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''neki achchhey akhlaq ka naam hai aur gunah wo hai jo tumharey dil mein khatak paida karey aur logon ka is par bakhabar hona hona tum par nagawar guzrey.''"
"2501","mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey huye suna : ''Allah Tabarak w taala ney farmaya : meri azmat aur buzurgi key liye aapas mein mohabbat karney walon key liye qiyamat key din Noor ( roshni ( key aisey member hongey jin par anbiya aur shuda bhi rashk karen.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Abu-Darda , ibne-Masood , Ubada bin Samit , Abu-Hurera aur abu Malik Ash-ari (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2502","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''saat qism key log aisey hain jinhen Allah Taala us din ke jab uskey ( arsh key ( saye key ilawa koi saya na hoga apney arsh key saye mein jagah dega : un mein sey eik insaf karney wala hukmaran hai, doosra wo nojawan hai jo Allah ki ibadat mein pala-badha padhi. , teesra wo shakhs hai jis ka dil masjid mein laga huwa ho,  chotha wo do aadmi jinhoney sirf Allah ki raza key liye eik doosrey key sath mohabbat ki usi key wastey jama hotey hain aur usi key wastey alag hotey hain, paanchwan wo aadmi jo tanhai mein Allah ka zikr karey aur azabe Ilaahi key khof mein aansu bahaaey, chhata wo aadmi jisey khoobsurat aurat gunah ki dawat dey, lekin wo kahey ke mujhey Allah ka khof hai, saatwaan wo aadmi jisney koi sadqa kiya to usey chhupaya yahan tak ke uskey baaein hath ko bhi na pata chaley ke daain haath ney kya kharch kiya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- ye hadees Imam Malik bin Anas sey iskey ilawa dusri sanadon sey bhi isi key jaisi marvi (riwayat hui) hai, in mein bhi Raavi ney shak ka izhar kiya hai aur kaha hai « an abi Huraira Aw an abi Saeed » aur Ubedullah bin umr Umri ney is hadees ko Khubaib bin Abdur-Rehman sey baghair shak key riwayat kiya hai, is mein unhoney sirf « an abi Huraira » kaha hai."
"2503","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab tum mein sey koi apney kisi musalman bhai sey mohabbat karey to wo apni us mohabbat sey aagah kar dey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Miqdam ki hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai. 2- is bab mein Abu-Zar aur Anas Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2504","eik shakhs ney khadey ho kar eik ameer ki tareef shuru ki to Miqdaad bin Amr Kandi (Raziallahu anhu) uskey chehrey par mitti dalney lagey , aur kaha : Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney hamein hukm diya hai ke tareef karney walon key munh mein mitti dal den. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- zyada ney ye hadees Mujahid sey, Mujahid ney ibne-Abbas Raziallahu anhuma sey riwayat ki hai halanke Mujahid ki riwayat jo Abu-Ma'mar sey hai wo ziyada sahih hai. 3- Abu-Ma'mar ka naam Abdullah bin Sakhbara hai aur Miqdaad bin Aswad Miqdaad bin Amr Al Kindi hain, jinki kunniyat abu Maabad hai. Aswad bin Abd Yaghus ki taraf un ki nisbat isliye ki gaee kyonkey unhoney Miqdaad ko ladakpan mein apna munh bola beta bana liya tha. 4- is bab mein Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"2505","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney hamein hukm diya ke hum be-ja tareef karney walon key munh mein mitti dal den. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki riwayat sey gharib hai."
"2506","unhoney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey huye suna : ''momin key siwa kisi ki sohbat ikhtiyar na karo, aur tumhara khana sirf muttaqi hi khaye.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan hai, isey hum sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain."
"2507","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab Allah Taala apney kisi bandey key sath khair aur bhalai ka irada karta hai to usey duniya hi mein jald saza dey deta hai padhi. , aur jab apney kisi bandey key sath shar ( burai (ka irada karta hai to uskey gunahon ki saza ko rokey rakhta hai. yahan tak ke qiyamat key din usey puri puri saza deta hai.''"
"2508","Ummul-momenin Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) ney kaha : mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key dard sey ziyada dard kisi shakhs ka nahin dekha. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2509","mainey arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! sab sey ziyada musibat kis par aati hai? aap ney farmaya : ''anbiya aur Rasool par , phir jo unkey baad martabe mein hain, phir jo unkey baad hain, bandey ki aazmaaish uskey Deen key mutabiq hoti hai, agar banda apney Deen mein sakht hai to uski musibat bhi sakht hoti hai aur agar wo apney Deen mein naram hota hai to uskey Deen key mutabiq musibat bhi hoti hai, phir musibat bandey key sath hamesha rehti hai, yahan tak ke banda roey zamin par is haal mein chalta hai ke is par koi gunah nahin hota.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. is baab mein Abu-Hurera aur Huzefa bin Yamaan ki behan Fatima (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi riwayat hai ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey sawal kiya gaya ke museebatein kis par ziyada aati hain? to aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Anbiya aur Rasool par phir jo unkey baad martabe mein hain phir jo unkey baad main hon.''"
"2510","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''momin mard aur momin aurat ki jaan, aulad, aur maal mein aazmaaishein aati rehti hain yahan tak ke jab wo marney key baad Allah sey mulaqat kartey hain to un par koi gunah nahin hota.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2511","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Allah taala farmata hai : jab main apney bandey ki piyari aankhen chheen leta hun to merey paas uska badla sirf jannat hi hai.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- is bab mein Abu-Hurera aur Zaid bin Arqam Raziallahu anhuma sey ahadees aai hain."
"2512","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Allah taala farmata hai : mainey jiski piyari aankhen chhin lein aur usney is par sabr kiya aur sawab ki ummid rakhi to main usey jannat key siwa aur koi badla nahin dunga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Arbaz bin Saariya (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"2513","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab qiyamat key din aisey logon ko sawab diya jaeyga jinki duniya mein aazmaaish hui thi to ehale-aafiyat khahish kerengey kaash! duniya mein unki khaalen qainchiyon sey katri jaatin.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, isey hum sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain. 2- baaz logon ney is hadees ka kuchh hissa (عن الأعمش an طلحة بن مصرف an"
"2514","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo bhi martaa hai wo naadim aur sharminda hota hai.''  Sahaba ney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! sharam aur nadaamat ki kya wajeh hai?'' aap ney farmaya : ''agar wo shakhs nek hai to usey is baat par nadaamat hoti hai ke wo ziyada sey ziyada neki na kar saka, aur agar wo bad hai to naadim hota hai ke mainey badi sey apney aap ko nikala kyon nahin.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is hadees ko hum sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain. 2- Yahya bin Ubedullah key barey mein Shoba ney kalam kiya hai, aur ye Yahya bin Ubedullah bin Mohab Madni hain."
"2515","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''aakhir zamaney mein kuchh aisey log niklengey jo Deen key sath duniya key bhi talab-gaar hongey, wo logon ko apni saadgi aur narmi dikhaney key liye bhaid ki khaal pahneingey, un ki zabanen shukr sey bhi ziyada meethi hongi jabke unkey dil bhadiyon key dil ki tarah hongey. Allah Taala farmata hai : kya ye log mujh par ghurur kartey hain ya mujh par jur'at kartey hain main apni zaat ki qism khata hun ke zarur main un par aisa fitna nazil karunga jis sey un mein ka aqlmand aadmi bhi hairaan reh jaeyga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : is baab mein Abdullah bin umr Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"2516","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Allah taala farmata hai : mainey eik aisi makhluq paida ki hai jinki zabanen shehad sey bhi ziyada meethi hain aur unkey dil eilwa key phal sey bhi ziyada kadwe hain, main apni zaat ki qism khata hun ! ke zarur main unkey darmiyan aisa fitna nazil karunga jis sey un mein ka aqlmand aadmi bhi hairaan reh jaaeyga, phir bhi ye mujh par ghurur kartey hain ya jur'at kartey hain?'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma ki riwayat sey Hasan gharib hai isey hum sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain."
"2517","mainey arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! najat ki kiya surat hai? aap ney farmaya : ''apni zaban ko qabu mein rakho, apney ghar ki wusat mein muqayyad raho aur apni khataaon par rotey raho.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan hai."
"2518","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''insan jab subah karta hai to uskey sarey aaza zaban key samney apni aajizi ka izhar kartey hain aur kehtey hain : to hamarey silsiley mein Allah sey dar isliye ke hum terey sath hain agar to sidhi rahi to hum sab sidhey rahengey aur agar to tedhi ho gaee to hum sab bhi tedhey ho jaeyngey.''"
"2519","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo mujh sey apni dono daadhon aur dono taangon key bech ka zaamin ho main uskey liye jannat ka zaamin hun.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Sehal bin Saad ki riwayat sey Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Abu-Hurera aur ibne-Abbas (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2520","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jisey Allah ney uski taangon aur daadhon key darmiyan ki chiz key shar aur fasad sey bacha liya wo jannat mein dakhil hoga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat karney waley Raavi Abu-Haazim ka naam Salman hai. ye Aza Ashjaiyya key azad karda ghulam hain aur koofi hain aur Sehal bin Saad sey riwayat karney waley Raavi Abu-Haazim ka naam Salma bin Dinar hai jo Zaahid Madni hain."
"2521","mainey arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! aap mujh sey aisi baat bayan farmaain jisey main mazbooti sey pakad lun, aap ney farmaya : ''kaho : mera rab (maboode-haqeeqi) Allah hai, phir isi ehad par qaaim raho.'' mainey arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! aap ko mujh sey kis chiz ka ziyada khof hai? aap ney apni zaban pakdi aur farmaya : ''isi ka ziyada khof hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- ye hadees Sufiyan bin Abdullah Saqafi sey kaee sanadon sey marvi (riwayat hui) hai."
"2522","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''zikre-Ilaahii key siwa kasrate kalam sey perhez karo isliye ke zikre Ilahi key siwa kasrate kalam dil ko sakht bana deta hai aur logon mein Allah sey sab sey ziyada door sakht dil wala hoga.''"
